      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nkuruon e nkiteng nanyokie",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Olaitoriani Musa o Aron, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ena enkitanapata naitanapishe Olaitoriani. Tiaaki iltung'ana le Israel pee kiyaki enkashe nanyokie nemeeta eleyiata nemeeta entioto neitu ae kata eenikini enchata emurt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nilo aisho ina ashe Eliesa olapolosani, neipang'ieki ninye aaya auluo nepuoi aayieng te dukuya ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore Eliesa olapolosani neya embata o sarge le ina ashe to lkimojino lenye, neisuaki embata e ilo sarge dukuya e ilo ng'obor le ntumo katitin naapishana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ina ashe nepejori, te dukuya ninye, nepejori olchoni lenye, o nkiri enyena, o sarge lenye nepejori sii imoyok enyena; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neya olapolosani nkeek o ltarakwai o mbenek e hisopo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19.6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "hisopo",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "enchani naji hisopo naasishoreki mbenek enyena te munyan",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", o enkarasha nanyokie nenang'aki empolos eine nepejorieki ina ashe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te siadi ina, neituku olapolosani ilkilani lenyena nebukoki kewan enkare, netum taa atijing'a ilng'oborri; kake keton ninye mesinya o metaa teipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilo opejoo ina ashe neituku ilkilani lenyena te nkare neituku osesen lenye te nkare, neton ninye mesinya o metaa teipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.9.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilh 9.13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore oltung'ani osinya nesotu nkuruon e ina ashe nelo apik auluo ilngoborri e ewueji nemetii olduruk; neshumi ninche te nkaraki eumata oo ltung'ana le Israel te nkaraki enkare naitisinyishoreki, te nkitukuoroto oo ng'ok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilo oiturrur nkuruon e ina ashe neituku ilkarash lenyena neton ninye mesinya o metaa teipa. Naa keaku ena te nkaraki iltung'ana le Israel o te nkaraki ilo omoni otamanyishe ti atua ninche, enkitanapata ena oo nkatitin pooki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enyikakinoto o lmeneng'ani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore ilo oiseyie olmeneng'ani le likae tung'ani ake ninye, nesarkionu nkolong'i naapishana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nchoo ninye eituku kewan te nkare te nkolong e uni o te nkolong e naapishana, pee etum taa atisinyayu; kake te nemeituku ninye kewan te nkolong e uni o te nkolong e naapishana, nemesinyayu ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pooki ng'ae oiseyie olmeneng'ani, ilo sesen ake ninye lo ltung'ani otua, nemeituku kewan, neiduruku olng'obor lo Laitoriani, ore ilo tung'ani nedung'ori aaiwuang'ie ti atua Israel; enkaraki neitu eisuakini enkare enkitisinyata shumata ninye, keaku ninye mesinya eton olduruk lenye te shumata ninye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ena ninye enkitanapata te neye oltung'ani ti atua olng'obor: ore pooki ng'ae ojing'u atua olng'obor, o pooki ng'ae otii atua olng'obor neaku olemesinya nkolong'i naapishana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pooki toki nang'a nemepising'a neiduruku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pooki ng'ae ti ong'ata oiseyie ilo otasesekuanaki to lalem, aashu olmeneng'ani, aashu oloito lo ltung'ani, aashu enkurare neaku olemesinya nkolong'i naapishana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te ilo lemesinya nchoo eyae embata oo nkuruon e ilo asar otapejoyioki loo ng'ok, o enkare naruko napiki empirbil; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nelotu taa oltung'ani osinya aitayu mbenek e nchani naji hisopo, neitadoiki atua ina are, neisuaki shumata ilo ng'obor, o shumata imasaa pooki ilorikan o shumata lelo tung'ana ootii ine, o shumata ilo oiseyie oloito, aashu olotasesekuanaki, aashu olotua, aashu enkurare; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore ilo tung'ani osinya neisuaki ilo tung'ani lemesinya te nkolong e uni o te nkolong e naapishana, ore te nkolong e naapishana neitisiny ninye, neituku ninye ilkilani lenyena neituku kewan te nkare, ore pee eaku teipa nesinyayu ninye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kake ore ilo tung'ani lemesinya nemeituku kewan, nedung'ori ilo tung'ani aitung'uaa atua eumata, enkaraki naidurukie ewueji sinyati o Laitoriani; enkaraki neitu ebukokini enkare e enkitisinyata shumata ninye, mesinya ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa keaku enkitanapata oo nkatitin pooki te ninche. Ore ilo oisuaaya ina are naitisinyishoreki neituku ilkilani lenyena neaku mesinya o metaa teipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore entoki pooki naba anaa enaiseyie oltung'ani lemesinya neaku enemesinya; ore pooki ng'ae oiseyie ina neaku oltung'ani le mesinya o metaa teipa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.19.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
